    "body": "Can you drop \"run\" and \"algorithm\" since these things are invoked by just naming them elsewhere?\n\nAnd @domenic, can you check the phrasing of this ? I won't block merging on it, but it'd be good to have a second pair of eyes on this somewhat odd construct.\n",
