      "user_view_type": "public",
      "site_admin": false
    },
    "body": "Looking at this again, would it make sense to put it where the paused attribute changes from false to true, similar to the structure (if false then set to true and fiddle with promises) in the internal pause steps? It wouldn't be exactly the same thing, but can we have pending play promises if paused is already true?\n",
